<title>USA: RESEACH ALERT - BroadBand EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEACH ALERT - BroadBand EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Chandan Sarkar cut his 1997 earnings estimate to a loss of $2.48 a share from a loss of $1.88 a share.</p>
<p>-- said he cut the 1998 earnings estimate to a loss of $1.44 a share from a profit of $0.38 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the ratings remain unchanged as short-term and long-term holds.</p>
<p>-- BroadBand lost 5/8 to 11-1/2 in late morning trade.</p>
</text>
